cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "MOSAIC-Ω: self-auditing agentic analysis exposes pseudoreplication in single-cell periodontitis"
abstract: >-
  A self-reconfiguring multi-agent architecture that governs analytic agents through
  a single convex Free-Energy Structural Control objective and carries an explicit
  self-assessment layer (adversarial falsification, blinded adjudication, and an
  overconfidence detector). Applied to two independent human gingival single-cell
  cohorts, it shows that only plasma-cell compositional remodelling replicates,
  while cell-level gene signatures are dominated by pseudoreplication — single-cell
  Wilcoxon testing calls 2,897 differentially expressed genes where a donor-level
  pseudobulk permutation test calls none.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Pradeep
    family-names: Kumar
    email: dr.pradeepperio@outlook.com
    affiliation: "Saveetha Dental College and Hospitals, Saveetha Institute of Medical and Technical Sciences"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Pkr2180/mosaic-omega-periodontitis"
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
keywords:
  - single-cell RNA sequencing
  - periodontitis
  - multi-agent systems
  - pseudoreplication
  - reproducibility
  - free-energy principle

# Datasets analysed (not produced by this work).
references:
  - type: data
    title: "Single-cell RNA sequencing of human periodontal tissue (main cohort)"
    authors:
      - name: "NCBI Gene Expression Omnibus"
    url: "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/query/acc.cgi?acc=GSE171213"
    notes: "GSE171213 — 12 donors."
  - type: data
    title: "Single-cell atlas of human gingiva in health and periodontitis (external cohort)"
    authors:
      - name: "NCBI Gene Expression Omnibus"
    url: "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/query/acc.cgi?acc=GSE164241"
    notes: "GSE164241 — Moutsopoulos laboratory, NIH."

